+# Changelog
+
+## 2025-10-26
+- Added system plugin with `/health` and `/version`.
+- Env-driven CORS, rate limit flag, security headers (helmet), CSP report-only + `/csp-report` endpoint.
+- Optional Sentry init and error handler.
+- `.env.example` updated, VSCode tasks, test scripts, and GitHub Actions CI to inject build metadata.
